				<wikidot:authorName>Voct</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>392303</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Perhaps it should have a <em>third</em> character in its nomenclature? Because having <em>two</em> characters in its name would make it stand out amongst the ones whose names have three and four characters.</p> <p>How about 'thorn' þ ?</p> <p>Ksi (obsolete Cyrillic character)<br /> Lambda (Greek character)<br /> Thorn (obsolete Old English character)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
